<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
        <title>LearnHub - Online Learning Platform</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f7fc;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        nav {
            background: #252550;
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 7%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        nav h2 {
            color: #70e1f5;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #70e1f5;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 75px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #252550, #6257c5);
            color: white;
            animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #70e1f5;
            color: #252550;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: white;
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }

        section {
            padding: 55px 8%;
        }

        .title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 30px;
            color: #252550;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .courses {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 18px #00000015;
            transition: 0.3s;
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px #00000025;
        }

        .thumbnail {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #70e1f5, #6257c5);
            color: white;
            height: 150px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 50px;
        }

        .card-content {
            padding: 22px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #5145a5;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #e9e8ff;
            color: #5145a5;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .progress {
            height: 10px;
            background: #ddd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 12px 0;
        }

        .progress div {
            height: 100%;
            background: #6257c5;
            border-radius: 10px;
            animation: grow 1.5s ease;
        }

        .objectives {
            background: #e9eaff;
        }

        .objectives ul {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: auto;
            padding-left: 25px;
        }

        .objectives li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        footer {
            background: #252550;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 22px;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes grow {
            from {
                width: 0;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            nav {
                justify-content: center;
            }

            nav ul {
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }

            section {
                padding: 40px 6%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <nav>
        <h2>LearnHub</h2>

        <ul>
            <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#courses">Courses</a></li>
            <li><a href="#instructors">Instructors</a></li>
            <li><a href="#objectives">Objectives</a></li>
            <li><a href="#progress">My Progress</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero" id="home">
        <h1>Welcome to LearnHub</h1>

        <p>Learn New Skills. Build Your Future.</p>

        <p>Explore courses and learn at your own pace.</p>

        <a href="#courses" class="btn">Explore Courses</a>
    </header>

    <section id="courses">
        <h2 class="title">Popular Courses</h2>

        <div class="courses">

            <div class="card">
                <div class="thumbnail">💻</div>

                <div class="card-content">
                    <span class="tag">Programming</span>
                    <h3>Python Programming</h3>
                    <p>Learn Python basics, variables, loops, and functions.</p>
                    <p><strong>Instructor:</strong> Rahul Sharma</p>
                    <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 6 weeks</p>
                    <a href="#objectives" class="btn">View Course</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="thumbnail">🌐</div>

                <div class="card-content">
                    <span class="tag">Web Development</span>
                    <h3>HTML and CSS</h3>
                    <p>Learn to design and build responsive websites.</p>
                    <p><strong>Instructor:</strong> Priya Kumar</p>
                    <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 4 weeks</p>
                    <a href="#objectives" class="btn">View Course</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="thumbnail">🤖</div>

                <div class="card-content">
                    <span class="tag">Artificial Intelligence</span>
                    <h3>Introduction to AI</h3>
                    <p>Explore AI concepts, applications, and tools.</p>
                    <p><strong>Instructor:</strong> Anil Verma</p>
                    <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 5 weeks</p>
                    <a href="#objectives" class="btn">View Course</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="instructors">
        <h2 class="title">Meet Our Instructors</h2>

        <div class="courses">

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>👨‍🏫 Rahul Sharma</h3>
                    <p>Python Programming Instructor</p>
                    <p>Focuses on beginner-friendly coding lessons.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>👩‍🏫 Priya Kumar</h3>
                    <p>Web Development Instructor</p>
                    <p>Teaches HTML, CSS, and responsive design.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>👨‍🏫 Anil Verma</h3>
                    <p>Artificial Intelligence Instructor</p>
                    <p>Introduces learners to AI technologies.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="objectives" id="objectives">
        <h2 class="title">Learning Objectives</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Understand basic programming concepts.</li>
            <li>Create web pages using HTML and CSS.</li>
            <li>Learn introductory artificial intelligence concepts.</li>
            <li>Develop logical thinking and problem-solving skills.</li>
            <li>Build small projects using the skills learned.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="progress">
        <h2 class="title">My Learning Progress</h2>

        <div class="courses">

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>Python Programming</h3>
                    <p>Course completion: 60%</p>

                    <div class="progress">
                        <div style="width: 60%;"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>HTML and CSS</h3>
                    <p>Course completion: 75%</p>

                    <div class="progress">
                        <div style="width: 75%;"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3>Introduction to AI</h3>
                    <p>Course completion: 35%</p>

                    <div class="progress">
                        <div style="width: 35%;"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 LearnHub. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        <p>Keep Learning, Keep Growing!</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
